### Issue: Ollama Model Won't Load
**Symptoms:** Out of memory error, slow loading

**Diagnosis:**
```powershell
nvidia-smi  # Check VRAM usage
ollama ps   # Check running models
```

**Solutions:**
1. Use smaller quantization (Q4 instead of Q5)
2. Close other GPU applications (Chrome, games)
3. Try 3B model instead of 7B
4. Restart Ollama service

